{"theory":"pf8-cr","chiral_algebra":"\\mathrm{PF}_{8}^{C}","Z_tex":"Z = \\tfrac12\\big(Z_{1,1}+Z_{1,g}+Z_{g,1}+Z_{g,g}\\big),\\quad Z_{1,g} = \\sum_{l\\ \\mathrm{even}}|t_l|^2 - |t_f|^2,\\quad Z_{g,1} = \\sum_{y>0}|\\mathcal{T}_y|^2 + \\mathcal{T}_0\\overline{\\tilde{\\mathcal{T}}_0} + \\tilde{\\mathcal{T}}_0\\overline{\\mathcal{T}_0}","character_tex":"Parafermion characters (string functions) $\\Phi^l_m$ from $\\chi^{SU(2)_k}_l(\\tau,z) = \\sum_{m\\in\\mathbb{Z}_{2k}}\\Phi^l_m(\\tau)\\,\\Theta_{m,k}(\\tau,z)/\\eta(\\tau)$, fields $(l,m)\\sim(k-l,m+k)$. On the $C$-fixed fields $(l,0)$, $l$ even, the twined characters are $t_l = (-1)^{l/2}\\eta(2\\tau)^{-1}\\sum_{x\\equiv l+1\\ (2K)}\\sin\\frac{\\pi x}{2}\\,q^{x^2/4K}$, $K = k+2$, and $\\Phi^{l,\\pm}_0 = \\frac12(\\Phi^l_0\\pm t_l)$. Twisted characters: $\\mathcal{T}_y = \\eta(\\tau/2)^{-1}\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb{Z}}(-1)^n q^{(y+2Kn)^2/16K}$ ($y\\equiv k$ mod 2, $0<y\\le k$), of weight $h = \\frac{k-2+y^2}{16K}$; $\\mathcal{T}^{\\pm}_y$ are its parts with $L_0-h$ in $\\mathbb{Z}$ and $\\mathbb{Z}+\\frac12$. For even $k$ the fixed field $(k/2,\\pm k/2)$ has $t_f = \\eta(2\\tau)/\\eta(\\tau)$, $\\Phi^{k/2,\\pm}_{k/2} = \\frac12(\\Phi^{k/2}_{k/2}\\pm t_f)$, and the $y=0$ twisted characters are $\\mathcal{T}_0 = \\frac12(D_0 + B)$, $\\tilde{\\mathcal{T}}_0 = \\frac12(D_0 - B)$ with $D_0 = \\eta(\\tau/2)^{-1}\\sum_n(-1)^n q^{Kn^2/4}$ and $B = \\eta(\\tau/2)/\\eta(\\tau)$. Here $k = 8$.","description":"Orbifold of the diagonal $\\mathbb{Z}_{8}$ parafermion theory by the reflection $Cr$ (Dijkgraaf-Vafa-Verlinde-Verlinde 1989). For even $k$ the dihedral reflections form two classes, $C$ and $Cr$; they act alike on the fields $(l,0)$ and differ by a sign on the fixed field $(4,\\pm4)$, where the rotation $r$ is $-1$. Here that sign is $-1$: the untwisted sector pairs $\\Phi^{4,\\pm}_{4}$ with $\\Phi^{4,\\mp}_{4}$, and the twisted sector, from Poisson resummation of $Z_{1,g}$, pairs $\\mathcal{T}_0$ with $\\tilde{\\mathcal{T}}_0$; both sectors are projected to integer spin.","generator":"scripts/spectra/gen_pf_orbifolds.py","c":"7/5","irreducible":true,"cutoff":"8","s_error":1.1e-15,"gap":"7/80","blocks":[{"label":"\\Phi^{0,+}_{0}","h":"0","coeffs":[1,0,1,1,3,3,7,8,16]},{"label":"\\Phi^{0,-}_{0}","h":"3","coeffs":[1,1,3,4,8,11]},{"label":"\\Phi^{1}_{-1}","h":"7/160","coeffs":[1,1,2,4,7,12,20,32,50]},{"label":"\\Phi^{2}_{-2}","h":"3/40","coeffs":[1,1,3,5,10,16,28,43,70]},{"label":"\\Phi^{2,+}_{0}","h":"1/5","coeffs":[1,1,2,3,6,9,16,24,39]},{"label":"\\Phi^{2,-}_{0}","h":"6/5","coeffs":[1,1,3,4,9,13,23,34]},{"label":"\\Phi^{3}_{-3}","h":"3/32","coeffs":[1,1,3,6,11,19,32,51,81]},{"label":"\\Phi^{3}_{-1}","h":"11/32","coeffs":[1,2,4,7,13,22,36,58,91]},{"label":"\\Phi^{4,+}_{-4}","h":"1/10","coeffs":[1,1,2,4,7,11,19,29,46]},{"label":"\\Phi^{4,-}_{-4}","h":"21/10","coeffs":[1,2,5,8,15,24,40]},{"label":"\\Phi^{4}_{-2}","h":"19/40","coeffs":[1,2,4,8,14,24,40,64,100]},{"label":"\\Phi^{4,+}_{0}","h":"3/5","coeffs":[1,1,3,4,9,13,23,34,56]},{"label":"\\Phi^{4,-}_{0}","h":"8/5","coeffs":[1,2,4,7,12,20,33,51]},{"label":"\\Phi^{5}_{-3}","h":"19/32","coeffs":[1,2,4,8,14,24,40,64,100]},{"label":"\\Phi^{5}_{-1}","h":"27/32","coeffs":[1,2,5,9,16,27,45,71,111]},{"label":"\\Phi^{6}_{-4}","h":"7/10","coeffs":[1,2,4,7,13,22,36,57,90]},{"label":"\\Phi^{6}_{-2}","h":"43/40","coeffs":[1,2,5,8,16,25,43,66]},{"label":"\\Phi^{6,+}_{0}","h":"6/5","coeffs":[1,1,3,5,9,14,24,36]},{"label":"\\Phi^{6,-}_{0}","h":"11/5","coeffs":[1,2,4,7,13,21,34]},{"label":"\\Phi^{7}_{-5}","h":"127/160","coeffs":[1,2,3,6,10,17,28,44,68]},{"label":"\\Phi^{7}_{-3}","h":"207/160","coeffs":[1,2,4,7,13,21,34,54]},{"label":"\\Phi^{7}_{-1}","h":"247/160","coeffs":[1,2,4,8,14,23,38,59]},{"label":"\\Phi^{8}_{-6}","h":"7/8","coeffs":[1,1,2,3,6,9,16,24,38]},{"label":"\\Phi^{8}_{-4}","h":"3/2","coeffs":[1,1,3,4,8,12,21,30]},{"label":"\\Phi^{8}_{-2}","h":"15/8","coeffs":[1,1,3,5,9,14,24,35]},{"label":"\\Phi^{8,+}_{0}","h":"2","coeffs":[1,1,2,3,6,8,14]},{